  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>In addition or subtractions, final answer must contain the equal numbers of digits after decimal as the adding or subtracting quantities among&nbsp;which is having the lowest numbers of digits after decimal.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>24.36</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0.0724</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>256.2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>280.6324</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>280</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p>The Least number of&nbsp; significant digit after decimal&nbsp; in the above expression is 1 So, Sum should conatian 1 significant digit after decimal.<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>24.44</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>16.082</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>240.2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>280.722</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>280.7</mn></math></p><p>The Least number of&nbsp; significant digit after decimal&nbsp; in the above expression is 1 So, Sum should conatian 1 significant digit after decimal<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>25.2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>19.2812</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>236.183</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>280.6642</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>280</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>7</mn></math></p><p>The Least number of&nbsp; significant digit after decimal&nbsp; in the above expression is 1 So, Sum should conatian 1 significant digit after decimal<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>236.191</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>19.5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>280.691</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>281</mn></math></p><p>The Least number of&nbsp; significant digit after decimal&nbsp; in the above expression is 0 So, Sum should conatian&nbsp;0 significant digit after decimal<br />Answer should be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#60;</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#60;</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math></p>",
